    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39834" root="نشط" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِئْرٌ نَشُوطٌ</span></b>  <i>A well from which the bucket does not
come forth until it is much pulled,</i> (As, S, TA,)
<i>by reason of the distance of its bottom;</i> (TA;)
<i>contr. of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِئْرٌ أَنْشَاطٌ</span>. (K.)

